                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb74ec73-aa04-3d4a-8949-c569cd17b39d",
                        "entry_id": "b613ba26-ded3-3fa6-a128-1f4b2b1cf5f0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Menshevik (a member of a faction of the Russian revolutionary movement)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e04f99de-b323-407f-a4cf-f6a2705ce310",
                                "sense_id": "cb74ec73-aa04-3d4a-8949-c569cd17b39d",
                                "text": "Сколько раз тов. Мартов и всякие другие «меньшевики» занимались не менее детским изобличением меня в следующем «противоречии».",
                                "translation": "How many times Comrade Martov and various other “Mensheviks” have convicted me, no less childishly, of the following “contradiction”.",
                                "english": "How many times Comrade Martov and various other “Mensheviks” have convicted me, no less childishly, of the following “contradiction”."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6af27a70-0ee1-410e-a9d8-dfb64aa158ef",
                                "sense_id": "cb74ec73-aa04-3d4a-8949-c569cd17b39d",
                                "text": "Это раскассирование заключается в том, что в боевые комитеты большинства посылаются компании меньшевиков, которые ведут осаду комитета, ведут агитацию, стараясь всячески подорвать доверие к комитету в обществе, у рабочих и особенно у периферии.",
                                "translation": "This is done by sending into the militant Majority committees Minority groups which lay siege to the committee, carry on agitation in order to undermine confidence in it among the public, among the workers, and especially in the periphery.",
                                "english": "This is done by sending into the militant Majority committees Minority groups which lay siege to the committee, carry on agitation in order to undermine confidence in it among the public, among the workers, and especially in the periphery."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
